 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">beta-L-IdoA2S-(1-&gt;3)-beta-D-GalNAc4S-(1-&gt;4)-beta-D-GlcA-(1-&gt;3)-beta-D-GalNAc4S</bp:name>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An amino tetrasaccharide comprised of an L-iduronic acid residue, sulfated on O-2, a glucuronic acid residue, and two N-acetylated galactosamine residues, one of which is at the reducing end and both of which are sulfated on O-4. It is an intermediate in the chondroitin sulfate degradation pathway.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://www.ra.cs.uni-tuebingen.de/software/KEGGtranslator/glG13041.eref</bp:comment>
