 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2-O-sulfo-beta-D-glucuronosyl-(1-&gt;4)-6-O-sulfo-N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosaminyl-(1-&gt;4)-D-glucuronic acid</bp:name>
