 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A linear trisaccharide derivative that consists of 2-sulfated beta-D-glucuronic acid, 6-sulfated N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosamine and beta-D-glucuronic acid units connected in sequence by (1-&gt;4)-linkages. An intermediate glycan involved in the degradation of heparan sulfate.</bp:comment>
