 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A linear amino trisaccharide that consists of a 6-sulfated N-acetyl-alpha-D-glucosamyl residue flanked by two beta-D-glucuronic acid units connected by (1-&gt;4)-linkages. An intermediate glycan involved in the degradation of heparan sulfate.</bp:comment>
